{
  "name": "Competitor Retail Stockists & Buyer Email Wholesale Outreach Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Retail Stockist & Buyer Email Discovery Pipeline (All-in-One)\n\nReads competitor brand websites from **Google Sheets**, discovers every physical boutique & retailer carrying those brands, enriches each unique store website with prioritized **wholesale/buyer emails, Instagram, LinkedIn, and Contact Form URLs**, filters out giant national chains, logs every store to Google Sheets, and routes top-scoring boutique buyers to Slack `#wholesale-leads` + Gmail while sending social-only boutiques to `#retail-ops`.\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/brand-store-locator-stockist-email-enricher\n**GitHub MCP & Kit:** https://github.com/wonderpick/apify-b2b-ecom-automation-kit\n**Cost:** $5.00 / 1,000 retail stores · **$0 for filtered chains or empty results** · 128–256 MB RAM · $0 proxy.",
        "height": 290,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview & Cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Competitor Brand List (Google Sheets -> Batch Payload)\n\nCreate a spreadsheet with three tabs:\n- **`Brands`**: columns `brandUrl` (e.g. `https://fellowproducts.com`, `https://brooklynhotdogcompany.com`), optional `countryFilter` (e.g. `US`), optional `maxStoresPerBrand` (default `100`).\n- **`StockistLeads`**: columns `brandUrl`, `storeName`, `outreachTier`, `outreachReadinessScore`, `retailerType`, `city`, `state`, `country`, `primaryEmail`, `emailType`, `phone`, `website`, `instagram`, `contactPageUrl`, `scrapedAt`.\n- **`SocialOnlyBoutiques`**: columns `brandUrl`, `storeName`, `city`, `country`, `website`, `instagram`, `contactPageUrl`, `phone`, `scrapedAt`.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 1. Competitor Brand List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. All-in-One Stockist + Buyer Email Engine\n\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://apify.com) and generate an API token (`Settings -> API & Integrations`).\n2. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <your_apify_token>`) and attach it to **Extract Stockists & Buyer Emails via Apify**.\n3. Boutiques without a direct email still keep 100% of their address/Instagram/contact form info and route to `SocialOnlyBoutiques`.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 2. Stockist & Buyer Email Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Readiness Tiering, Sheet Sync & Sales Routing\n\n- **All email-ready stockists** are logged to `StockistLeads` in Google Sheets.\n- **VIP_BUYER** (`outreachReadinessScore >= 85` or `emailType === 'wholesale_buyer'`) -> Slack `#wholesale-leads` + Gmail pitch brief.\n- **DIRECT_BOUTIQUE** & **NURTURE** -> Slack `#retail-ops`.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000104",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 3. Readiness Tiering & Sales Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1740,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                3
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Weekly Stockist Discovery Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        520
      ]
    },
